{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13221160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115001:":{"text":"여신이시여...","source_cn":"女神啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B1000F3820762C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115002:":{"text":"저들에게 영원한 안식을 내려주시고","source_cn":"请赐下永恒的安息","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A2B4FC526464571","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115003:":{"text":"여기서 죽은 모든 영혼들에게","source_cn":"让所有逝者的灵魂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADD2919254AD538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1322115004:":{"text":"축복을 내려주소서...","source_cn":"得到祝福与安宁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED7930FEE3B29DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322116001:1":{"text":"이상한데, 무슨 소리가... 거기, 거기 누구 있어요?","source_cn":"奇怪，什么声音……谁！谁在那里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169F8DB279AF7A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322116002:1":{"text":"음? 아가씨, 장례식에 참석하러 오신 건가요? 그런데 왜 묘지 뒤에서 나오시는지... 방금 묘지 뒤편을 순찰했을 때 아무도 없었는데요!","source_cn":"咦，这位女士，你是来参加葬礼仪式的吗？为什么会突然从墓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099580131DD0877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322116003:1":{"text":"전...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842BD49F1E0099A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322116004:1":{"text":"잠깐, 당신의 얼굴 빛이... 살아있는 시체처럼 창백하군요? 다, 당신... 인간이 아니야!","source_cn":"等等……你、你的脸色……苍白得和活死人一样！你——你不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFB57ECA6982AAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322116005:1":{"text":"네? 살아있는 시체라고요? 어, 어서 사람들을 해치지 못하게 막아요!","source_cn":"什么，活死人？！快……快拦住她，不要让她伤害这里的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91BA7DFFB4521AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322116006:1":{"text":"경고. 위협 감지!","source_cn":"警告，发现威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F2AD780DD859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322116007:1":{"text":"즉시 제거한다. 보호한다, 캐롤!","source_cn":"必须清除！保护，小卡莎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39A0F780DA8B9F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322116008:1":{"text":"듀라 여신이시여! 이, 이게 대체 뭐지... 무, 무슨 짓을 하려는 거야!","source_cn":"艾雅啊！这……这是什么东西……你……你们要干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17B4705845241F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322116009:1":{"text":"카렌 오빠, 멈춰! 해치면 안 돼!","source_cn":"铐兰哥哥，快住手！不要伤害他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2598C0ABE18D8C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322116010:1":{"text":"악마... 분명 악마의 권속이 분명해... 다들, 어서 도망치세요! 어서!","source_cn":"恶魔……他们肯定是恶魔的眷属！大家快跑、快跑啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8107B616D3B01F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117001:":{"text":"악마의 권속이 나타났어요. 도망쳐요!","source_cn":"恶魔眷属来了！快跑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA12F5891F420E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117002:":{"text":"도망쳐! 악마가 나타났다!","source_cn":"快跑！恶魔出现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88CC81DFC50FA0AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1322117003:":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，救救我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A1FF4AEF6028917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:13050313:0":{"text":"카렌이 캐롤라이나를 보호하기 위해 나타났지만, 사람들을 모두 놀래켜 도망치게 만들었다.","source_cn":"铐兰出现保护卡列琳娜，却意外吓跑了所有的民众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1865D919CA834B66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:13050312:0":{"text":"모두가 죽은 자를 위해 기도하던 중, 두 명의 수도사가 기도하러 온 캐롤라이나를 발견했다.","source_cn":"众人正为亡者祈祷时，两位修士发现了前来祈祷的卡列琳娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AC1C15A21BDB07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士费尔德南":{"text":"수도사 페르난","source":"修士费尔德南","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修女特里莎":{"text":"수녀 테리사","source":"修女特里莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铐兰":{"text":"카렌","source":"铐兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:参加葬礼的男子":{"text":"장례식에 참석한 남자","source":"参加葬礼的男子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:参加葬礼的老人":{"text":"장례식에 참석한 노인","source":"参加葬礼的老人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블